{#
  One dialog shared by every "who…?" list on the page — the reaction
  tallies and the "vu par" lines alike. Its trigger fetches the rendered
  list, sets the title from its own `data-dialog-title`, and fills the
  body with the response (public/assets/js/groups.js), rather than every
  post and reply carrying a dialog of its own.

  The title starts on the commonest of the two so a dialog opened before
  the title is set still says something true. The shared modal embed
  names the title `groups-detail-modal-title` — the id groups.js targets.
#}
{% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with { id: 'groups-detail-modal', title: 'Réactions' } only %}
    {% block body %}
        <div id="groups-detail-modal-body">
            <div class="text-center py-3">
                <span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm" role="status" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
